q("es-015", B, 3, FC, "Look at the food web. Which organism is the producer?", "Grass", [W("Grasshopper", "consumer", "It eats grass, so it is a consumer."), W("Rabbit", "consumer", "It eats grass, so it is a consumer."), W("Hawk", "consumer", "It eats other animals, so it is a consumer.")], ["Grass makes its own food and has no arrow pointing to it."], MEAD)
