q("es-017", B, 3, FC, "Look at the food web. Which organisms eat only plants?", "Grasshopper and rabbit", [W("Frog and snake", "wrong-reading", "They eat other animals."), W("Snake and hawk", "wrong-reading", "They eat other animals."), W("Grass and rabbit", "wrong-reading", "Grass is a plant and does not eat. It makes its own food.")], ["Only the grasshopper and the rabbit have arrows coming straight from grass."], MEAD)
