q("es-205", C, 3, FC, "Look at the food web. Which two organisms compete for the same food?", "Mouse and rabbit", [W("Frog and fox", "wrong-pair", "Frogs eat grasshoppers and foxes eat rabbits, so they do not share food."), W("Owl and fox", "wrong-pair", "Owls eat mice and snakes and foxes eat rabbits, so they do not share food."), W("Grasshopper and owl", "wrong-pair", "Grasshoppers eat grass and owls eat mice and snakes, so they do not share food.")], ["The mouse and the rabbit both eat grass and shrub."], FOR)
